{"title":"Minimalistic City Map Posters","link":"https://kottke.org/26/02/minimalistic-city-map-posters","date":1770160926000,"content":"\n         <a href=\"https://github.com/originalankur/maptoposter\">This Github project</a> from Ankur Gupta allows you to “generate beautiful, minimalist map posters for any city in the world”. There are a variety of different themes you can choose from and the resulting images are big enough to print out actual posters (20-inch height maximum).\n\n<img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48296-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48296-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48296-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"2000\" />\n\n<img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48296-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48296-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48296-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"2000\" />\n\n<img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48296-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48296-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48296-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"2000\" />\n\nYou can install <a href=\"https://github.com/originalankur/maptoposter\">the Python scripts</a> on your computer or <a href=\"https://maptoposter.penk.in/\">use this website</a> (which seems quite slow). Also, I wonder if the height/width minimums can be changed to output bigger posters? \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Ankur%20Gupta\">Ankur Gupta</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/maps\">maps</a></p>\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/26/02/minimalistic-city-map-posters\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"2ed2e5a595ec0f882881c78a83fb59e307c7b86f4ff12fdedc71aea3a710f7a7","category":"Sites"}